  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "29C29705FA754865",
      "text": "Tadaaa! Da wär’n wir![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_01",
      "hash64": "CA06862959B06CF0",
      "text": "Ähm, sollten wir uns wirklich hier herumtreiben?\\nDu weißt schon, wegen meinem Bruder...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "29C29405FA75434C",
      "text": "Ach, Jo? Nee, so schnell taucht der nich’ wieder\\nim AG-Raum auf.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_02",
      "hash64": "CA06892959B07209",
      "text": "Na gut...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "29C29505FA7544FF",
      "text": "Das ist jedenfalls das Hauptquartier der\\nLiga-AG![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_24",
      "hash64": "29BC0E05FA6FF3EC",
      "text": "Im Namen aller Mitglieder heiß ich dich hiermit\\nherzlich willkommen![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_01",
      "hash64": "BB9D8612C0B5C998",
      "text": "Die Liga-AG?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_02",
      "hash64": "BB9D8912C0B5CEB1",
      "text": "Was für eine AG ist das?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "29C29205FA753FE6",
      "text": "Hehe. Gut, dass du fragst![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "29C29305FA754199",
      "text": "An der Blaubeer-Akademie gibt’s die sogenannte\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Blaubeer-Liga[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]. Das ist eine Art Rangsystem für\\r\\ndie Kampfstärke der Schüler.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "29C29005FA753C80",
      "text": "Und um dabei gut abzuschneiden, trainieren wir\\nvon der Liga-AG zusammen unsere Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "29C29105FA753E33",
      "text": "Aber keine Sorge, in unserer AG geht’s total\\nlocker zu. Wir haben einfach Spaß, egal, ob wir\\r\\ngewinnen oder verlieren![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_03",
      "hash64": "CA06882959B07056",
      "text": "Also... Im Prinzip stimmt das, auch wenn einige\\nes anders sehen würden...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_08",
      "hash64": "29C29E05FA75544A",
      "text": "Hach ja, im Moment ist der Vibe hier ’n bisschen\\nanders als sonst.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_04",
      "hash64": "CA068B2959B0756F",
      "text": "Ich bin auch Mitglied, aber ehrlich gesagt\\nkomm ich nicht oft in den AG-Raum.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_05",
      "hash64": "CA068A2959B073BC",
      "text": "Die vier stärksten Trainer in der Blaubeer-Liga\\nsind übrigens die [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Blaubeer-Top-Vier[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_06",
      "hash64": "CA068D2959B078D5",
      "text": "Und diese Witzfigur mit der Zahnpasta-Frisur ist\\neiner davon. Genau wie das Mädel, mit dem ich\\r\\nvorhin in der Kuppel gequatscht hab.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_09",
      "hash64": "29C29F05FA7555FD",
      "text": "Hana selbst steht nicht mal auf der Rangliste,\\nnebenbei bemerkt.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_07",
      "hash64": "CA068C2959B07722",
      "text": "Ich bin eben zu beschäftigt mit außerschulischen\\nAktivitäten, um an Liga-Kämpfen teilzunehmen![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_08",
      "hash64": "CA068F2959B07C3B",
      "text": "Wenn es um reine Stärke geht, bin ich den\\nTop Vier weit voraus. Ist ja wohl klar![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "29C61C05FA78603B",
      "text": "Hehehe, das is’ nich’ ganz falsch.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "29C61B05FA785E88",
      "text": "So, was meinst du, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\nZiemlich cool hier, oder?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "29C61E05FA7863A1",
      "text": "Sehr gut! Genau das wollt ich hören.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "29C61D05FA7861EE",
      "text": "Das sagst du jetzt nur so, aber tief in deinem\\nHerzen biste überzeugt, nich’ wahr?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "29C62005FA786707",
      "text": "Damit isses offiziell! Wir nehmen dich als\\nvorläufiges Mitglied auf![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_09",
      "hash64": "CA068E2959B07A88",
      "text": "Bitte was?! Vorläufiges Mitglied?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "29C61F05FA786554",
      "text": "Yeah! Und damit sind wir natürlich auch\\nvorläufige Buddys![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "29C62205FA786A6D",
      "text": "Der AG-Raum und all unser Zeug hier stehen\\ndir jetz’ zur freien Verfügung![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "29C62105FA7868BA",
      "text": "Dieser PC zum Beispiel ist total praktisch.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "29C61405FA7852A3",
      "text": "Damit können Schüler einander BP schicken,\\num sich gegenseitig auszuhelfen.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_25",
      "hash64": "29BC0F05FA6FF59F",
      "text": "Hier, probier’s einfach mal aus.\\nÜbung macht den Meister![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_system_01",
      "hash64": "55A13CED9668E81B",
      "text": "Du erhältst [VAR 0x0204(0001,202F)] BP von Levy!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0204",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "202F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_26",
      "hash64": "29BC1005FA6FF752",
      "text": "Wie wär’s, wenn du die an Pit aus der\\nBaseball-AG schickst, damit er dir neue\\r\\nWurfstile beibringt?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_stopper",
      "hash64": "5C70256EC271E689",
      "text": "Hey, was soll das denn werden? Du wolltest doch\\nmit dem PC ein paar BP verschicken.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_npc",
      "hash64": "0D009F273E33B18D",
      "text": "Es ist besser, wenn du’s ohne meine Hilfe machst.\\nBenutz den PC, um BP zu übertragen.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_npc",
      "hash64": "65C15D443538643A",
      "text": "Hmpf. Der Typ wird dich erst in Ruhe lassen,\\nwenn du machst, was er sagt...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_27",
      "hash64": "29BC1105FA6FF905",
      "text": "Schon erledigt? Nich’ schlecht![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_28",
      "hash64": "29BC1205FA6FFAB8",
      "text": "Und das, obwohl’s das erste Mal für dich war.\\nDu scheinst echt was draufzuhaben![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_30",
      "hash64": "29BF9005FA7306A9",
      "text": "Ich hab hier noch ein tolles Geschenk für dich.\\c\\nEin super Fang wie du kann damit sicher was\\nanfangen.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_31",
      "hash64": "29BF8F05FA7304F6",
      "text": "Hier, das kannst du auch noch haben. Wenn du\\ndas trägst, sind wir im Partnerlook unterwegs![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_system_02",
      "hash64": "55A13DED9668E9CE",
      "text": "Du erhältst ein [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Liga-AG-Outfit[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] von Levy!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_29",
      "hash64": "29BC1305FA6FFC6B",
      "text": "Wie gesagt, wir sind jetzt vorläufige AG-Buddys,\\nalso kannst du die Kiste benutzen, wann du willst.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "29C61305FA7850F0",
      "text": "Und hier hab ich noch ’nen Knaller für dich:\\nMomentan darfst du dir unbegrenzt viele Snacks\\r\\nnehmen! Ein besonderes AG-Angebot![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_10",
      "hash64": "CA03212959AD8B7A",
      "text": "Du meinst die ganzen Packungen, die du\\nangebrochen und dann vergessen hast?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_11",
      "hash64": "CA03222959AD8D2D",
      "text": "Keine Ahnung, wie lang die hier schon rumliegen.\\nLass besser die Finger davon.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "29BC0A05FA6FED20",
      "text": "So! Nach dem ganzen Erklären knurrt mir übelst\\nder Magen.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "29BC0B05FA6FEED3",
      "text": "Ich glaub, ich mach ’nen Abstecher in die Mensa.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_22",
      "hash64": "29BC0C05FA6FF086",
      "text": "Wenn du offiziell Mitglied werden willst, könnten\\nwir uns bei ’nem Mensa-Date drüber unterhalten.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_12",
      "hash64": "CA031F2959AD8814",
      "text": "Bei einem was?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_23",
      "hash64": "29BC0D05FA6FF239",
      "text": "Wir seh’n uns![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_13",
      "hash64": "CA03202959AD89C7",
      "text": "Argh! So ein Trottel! Was geht nur in seinem\\nKopf vor?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_14",
      "hash64": "CA031D2959AD84AE",
      "text": "Und ein Mensa-Date? Was soll das bitte\\nbedeuten?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_03",
      "hash64": "BB9D8812C0B5CCFE",
      "text": "Entspann dich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_04",
      "hash64": "BB9D8B12C0B5D217",
      "text": "Na ja, ein Date ist...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_15",
      "hash64": "CA031E2959AD8661",
      "text": "Ich sag ja nur! Als ob mich dieses Date-Gerede\\nauch nur im Geringsten interessieren würde...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_16",
      "hash64": "CA031B2959AD8148",
      "text": "Ich weiß, was das ist! Ich weiß nur nicht,\\nwas ich davon halten soll![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_17",
      "hash64": "CA031C2959AD82FB",
      "text": "Sorry... Dieser Raum stresst mich einfach.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_18",
      "hash64": "CA03192959AD7DE2",
      "text": "Lass uns woanders hingehen.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_19",
      "hash64": "CA031A2959AD7F95",
      "text": "Irgendwo, wo sich niemand einmischt.\\nWie wär’s mit deinem Zimmer?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_20",
      "hash64": "C9FF9B2959AA71F1",
      "text": "Du weißt nicht, wo dein Zimmer ist? Lauf einfach\\nmal drauflos, es ist nicht zu verfehlen![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
